\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=c_{a,A}\">\\(c=c_{a,A}\\)</span> 按上游定义；函数 oracle 编为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{graph}(c)\">\\(\\operatorname{graph}(c)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"858d5de23691d48d\" href=\"?note=858d5de23691d48d\" title=\"20-df-true-stage-function\">20-df-true-stage-function</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(a)\\subseteq2\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(a)\\subseteq2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A\">\\(a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}true-stage-equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{graph}(c)\\equiv_T A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}true-stage-equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{graph}(c)\\equiv_T A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 读取有限前缀，搜索第一个正确阶段，即算出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(x)\">\\(c(x)\\)</span>；从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 读取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(x,c(x))\">\\(a(x,c(x))\\)</span>，即得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(x)\">\\(\\chi_A(x)\\)</span>。搜索都终止。函数图编码与数值 oracle 的相互读取在全函数上有效。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.6.6(i)；印刷页 126；PDF 第 161 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-true-stage-function","status":"resolved","id":"858d5de23691d48d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-true-stage-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-teq","status":"resolved","id":"3dd875417abdd49f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-teq]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-true-stage-function","status":"resolved","id":"858d5de23691d48d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-true-stage-function]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-true-stage-function]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-teq","status":"resolved","id":"3dd875417abdd49f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-teq]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"c=c_{a,A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{graph}(c)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(a)\\subseteq2","display":false},{"tex":"a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A","display"